type: software
title: "Constraints on Stochastic Dark Energy from DESI DR2 BAO: A Null Result and the 10^56 Amplification Bottleneck"
authors:
  - family-names: "Morales Souhail"
    given-names: "Jesús"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-7637-1818"
    affiliation: "Independent researcher"
